WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:03,040
Please give me something to eat

2
00:00:03,770 --> 00:00:05,330
The child can't hold it anymore

3
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:06,890
My husband was out looking for supplies.

4
00:00:06,890 --> 00:00:10,520
I haven't come back for two days. Where are you staying?

5
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:11,920
End of the east side of the same floor

6
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:13,960
My name is Zhang Yun and my child’s name is Xiaoxuan.

7
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:18,420
Give these to the children first

8
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:21,140
Our supplies are also limited and there will be no next time

9
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:33,090
Thank you. Thank you, Ms. Ming.

10
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:35,130
What if the whole building comes to beg for help?

11
00:00:35,370 --> 00:00:37,010
So I can only do it this time

12
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:39,690
Don’t let good intentions become everyone’s storage room
